{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MKPKgsLoXLzXzV3A6Wf5RT","type":"tool_result","content":"> test\n> node --test tests/*.test.ts\n\n✔ health and profile (0.946375ms)\n✔ organizations scoped to user (0.136417ms)\n✔ logout revokes session (0.108875ms)\n✔ nonmember cannot read a project (0.919125ms)\n✔ nonmember cannot update a project (5.484ms)\n✔ missing project is 404, nonmember list is 403 (0.112458ms)\n✔ lists are cached per organization (0.1265ms)\n✔ cache keeps pagination and sorting variants distinct (0.1305ms)\n✔ cached list still requires membership, including after revocation (0.122875ms)\n✔ update invalidates every list variant of the owning organization only (0.20225ms)\n✔ organization IDs sharing prefixes or punctuation stay isolated (0.163458ms)\n✔ cached lists are snapshots even with a non-cloning cache (0.116875ms)\n✔ authenticated detail (0.608542ms)\n✔ authenticated list (5.493875ms)\n✔ update then read (0.135167ms)\n✔ anonymous request rejected (0.332958ms)\n✔ invalid update rejected (0.082083ms)\nℹ tests 17\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 17\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 86.612375\n M src/cache/keys.ts\n M src/services/project-service.ts\n?? tests/isolation.test.ts","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0cc4a784-f500-465e-9a2a-8e8de0c08b12","uuid":"e94e2503-ec5f-4ad8-b78b-05580785399d","timestamp":"2026-10-04T14:44:06.809Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"> test\n> node --test tests/*.test.ts\n\n✔ health and profile (0.946375ms)\n✔ organizations scoped to user (0.136417ms)\n✔ logout revokes session (0.108875ms)\n✔ nonmember cannot read a project (0.919125ms)\n✔ nonmember cannot update a project (5.484ms)\n✔ missing project is 404, nonmember list is 403 (0.112458ms)\n✔ lists are cached per organization (0.1265ms)\n✔ cache keeps pagination and sorting variants distinct (0.1305ms)\n✔ cached list still requires membership, including after revocation (0.122875ms)\n✔ update invalidates every list variant of the owning organization only (0.20225ms)\n✔ organization IDs sharing prefixes or punctuation stay isolated (0.163458ms)\n✔ cached lists are snapshots even with a non-cloning cache (0.116875ms)\n✔ authenticated detail (0.608542ms)\n✔ authenticated list (5.493875ms)\n✔ update then read (0.135167ms)\n✔ anonymous request rejected (0.332958ms)\n✔ invalid update rejected (0.082083ms)\nℹ tests 17\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 17\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 86.612375\n M src/cache/keys.ts\n M src/services/project-service.ts\n?? tests/isolation.test.ts","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfhNjCYuyNcMnmkhiVzFU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three reported bugs are fixed, and the full suite passes (17 tests: the 8 existing ones, unmodified, plus 9 new ones). Nothing is committed.\n\n## Root causes and fixes\n\n- **Cross-organization read/update**: `detail` in `src/services/project-service.ts` loaded the project and never checked membership, and `update` relied on `detail`. It now requires membership in the project's stored owning organization.\n- **Previous organization's list after switching**: the list cache key in `src/cache/keys.ts` took the organization ID but never used it, so all organizations shared entries. The key now includes the organization ID, JSON-encoded so IDs that share prefixes or contain `:` cannot collide. Page, page size, sort and direction remain in the key.\n- **Stale list after update**: `update` only deleted a detail key that is never written. It now deletes every cached list key under the owning organization's prefix, leaving other organizations' entries alone.\n\nCaching stays enabled, and the membership check still runs before the cache lookup, so cache hits are authorized and revocation takes effect immediately.\n\n## Behaviour you might not expect\n\n- For a non-member, a `PATCH` returns 403 even if the body is also invalid, because authorization is checked before body validation. A missing project still returns 404 first.\n- I also made the service clone list results going into and out of the cache. This was not in the bug report; it keeps cached lists as snapshots even when an injected cache does not clone.\n\n## Verification\n\nThe new tests in `tests/isolation.test.ts` cover:\n\n- A non-member gets 403 on read and on update, with no project fields returned, storage and update counter unchanged, and cache keys unchanged.\n- A non-member gets 403 on a list that is already cached, and a member gets 403 immediately after their membership is revoked, with no extra repository query.\n- Lists are cached per organization, and a repeated identical list does not query the repository again.\n- Page, page size, sort and direction variants are cached separately.\n- An update invalidates all four cached variants for its organization, while the other organization's cached list is still served from cache.\n- Organization IDs such as `org`, `org:1`, `org:1:10` and `org-a:1` stay isolated for both caching and invalidation.\n- Mutating a returned list does not affect later cached results when the injected cache does not clone."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4680,"cache_read_input_tokens":15995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4680},"output_tokens":637,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0cc4a784-f500-465e-9a2a-8e8de0c08b12","uuid":"ce79652f-1a99-4c79-9b9d-4a192408092e","timestamp":"2026-10-04T14:44:15.121Z","request_id":"req_011CfhNjCEpf8Hb1rfv9R28R"}
